# GitHub token used by the rollup loader to fetch each submodule's
# changelog/ and context-v/ via the GitHub Content API at build time.
#
# Anonymous mode works (60 req/hr rate limit) but you'll likely hit it
# during local dev as the loader recurses into context-v/. Setting either
# of these env vars raises the limit to 5000 req/hr.
#
# Pick whichever you have handy:
#  - GITHUB_TOKEN (CI sets this automatically inside Actions)
#  - GITHUB_API_TOKEN (recommended for local dev — distinguishes from any
#    GITHUB_TOKEN your shell may have set for gh/git-credential helpers)
#
# Required scopes: `public_repo` (for public repos in the org). For private
# submodules: `repo`. The token does not need write scopes.

GITHUB_API_TOKEN=
